icles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOTkdNUFZIbndOZzl0NXBuZHpYdkdkYlFFRkM5eEZLd1ZMZDFfM0hXVTB6d1N0UHZmMFY2TXd6Z2tWV3djSzZ5bW93eHNDX0JyYy0xZjZndmNoeUlVTndyQ2lWb1MzcnhzXzF6aU9TY3dvNDdzc0wxVU9VenctU2hrOUI4MWtNM2xYRGxKT0hsLXVzcXNHNHRHbTNMZFAxTUo0VU5Cc3lfUEtqYkEzMVIwZGVwaEc5YWs?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"Cadence 飆升 6%，積壓創紀錄的 82 億美元，「今年第三次」上調前景"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":4},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/813672/000081367226000016/cdns-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Cadence is a global technology leader that develops computational, AI-driven software, accelerated hardware, and silicon intellectual property (\"IP\") products and solutions. Our customers include semiconductor companies that design and manufacture integrated circuits (\"ICs\"), as well as systems companies that design and manufacture electromechanical systems containing various types of semiconductor and other electronics. Our products and solutions empower our customers to design and verify and bring to life new and innovative products. Our mission is to empower the world's most innovative companies to deliver extraordinary electronic products that drive the global economy and improve everyday life.","zh":"Cadence 是一家全球技術領導者，開發運算、人工智慧驅動的軟體、加速硬體以及矽知識產權 (“IP”) 產品和解決方案。我們的客戶包括設計和製造積體電路（“IC”）的半導體公司，以及設計和製造包含各種類型半導體和其他電子產品的機電系統的系統公司。我們的產品和解決方案使我們的客戶能夠設計和驗證新的創新產品並將其變為現實。我們的使命是幫助世界上最具創新力的公司提供卓越的電子產品，推動全球經濟並改善日常生活。"},{"en":"Designing even the simplest electronic systems is a sophisticated process that requires highly skilled engineers with specialized expertise. Our Intelligent System Design (\"ISD\") strategy enables us to address our customers' most challenging product development needs while expanding our capabilities beyond traditional chip design to encompass full electromechanical systems. By leveraging our deep expertise, we develop industry-leading computational AI-driven software, accelerated hardware, and IP solutions that adapt to our customers' evolving design requirements. This flexibility helps our customers address critical business priorities such as reducing time-to-market and advancing sustainability goals. To address the growing complexity of modern design, we've integrated cutting-edge technologies including agentic and generative AI, machine learning, and digital twin algorithms, into our","zh":"即使設計最簡單的電子系統也是一個複雜的過程，需要具有專業知識的高技能工程師。我們的智慧系統設計（“ISD”）策略使我們能夠滿足客戶最具挑戰​​性的產品開發需求，同時將我們的能力擴展到傳統晶片設計之外，涵蓋完整的機電系統。透過利用我們深厚的專業知識，我們開發業界領先的運算人工智慧驅動軟體、加速硬體和 IP 解決方案，以滿足客戶不斷變化的設計要求。這種靈活性有助於我們的客戶解決關鍵的業務優先事項，例如縮短上市時間和推動永續發展目標。為了解決現代設計日益複雜的問題，我們將代理和生成人工智慧、機器學習和數位孿生演算法等尖端技術整合到我們的設計中"},{"en":"Design Excellence: This pillar leverages our core expertise in AI-driven computational software and accelerated computing to deliver industry-leading electronic design, analysis, and verification products and solutions for semiconductors, which are embedded in many products and services that we use every day.","zh":"卓越設計：這項支柱利用我們在人工智慧驅動的運算軟體和加速運算方面的核心專業知識，為半導體提供業界領先的電子設計、分析和驗證產品和解決方案，這些產品和解決方案嵌入到我們每天使用的許多產品和服務中。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Revenue, and revenue as a percentage of total revenue, from our product and maintenance and services offerings for the last three fiscal years were as follows:","zh":"過去三個財年我們的產品、維護和服務產品的收入以及收入佔總收入的百分比如下："},{"en":"Product and maintenance revenue includes revenue from licensing our software and semiconductor IP, sales and leases of emulation hardware and the related maintenance on these licenses and sales.","zh":"產品和維護收入包括來自軟體和半導體IP授權、模擬硬體的銷售和租賃以及這些授權和銷售的相關維護的收入。"}],"customers":[{"en":"In addition, as previously disclosed, on May 23, 2025, BIS informed us that a license was required for the export, re-export or in-country transfer of EDA software and technology classified under Export Control Classification Numbers (ECCNs) 3D991 and 3E991 on the Commerce Control List (\"EDA Software and Technology\") when a party to the transaction is located in China or is a Chinese \"military end user\" on the \"Military End-User List,\" wherever located. On July 2, 2025, BIS informed us that the license requirements set forth in the May 23, 2025 letter from BIS were rescinded effective immediately. These restrictions have had, and any subsequent restrictions may have, an adverse effect on our business, results of operations or financial condition, either directly or by impacting our customers' products, and restrict our ability to license or support our products to certain companies in Ch","zh":"此外，如先前披露的，BIS 於 2025 年 5 月 23 日通知我們，如果交易方位於中國或是“軍事管制清單”上的中國“軍事最終用戶”，則出口、再出口或國內轉讓屬於商業管制清單上出口管制分類號 (ECCN) 3D991 和 3E991 屬於商業管制清單上出口管制分類號 (ECCN) 3D991 和 3E991 屬於商業管制清單上出口管制分類號 (ECCN) 3D991 和 3E991 屬於商業管制清單上的 EEDA 軟體和技術。最終用戶列表”，無論位於何處。2025 年 7 月 2 日，BIS 通知我們，BIS 2025 年 5 月 23 日信函中規定的許可要求已立即撤銷。這些限制已經以及任何後續限制可能直接或通過影響我們客戶的產品對我們的業務、經營業績或財務狀況產生不利影響，並限制我們向中國許可公司的某些產品的能力。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a highly competitive market, facing both domestic and international competition. Competition in our market is driven by several critical factors, including the ability to deliver continuous technological innovation, the quality and differentiation of product and service offerings, the strength and stability of customer relationships, the ability to attract and retain top engineering talent, and potential geopolitical trade restrictions. Our success hinges on providing comprehensive, integrated solutions that address the growing complexity of semiconductor and systems design.","zh":"我們在競爭激烈的市場中運營，面臨國內和國際競爭。我們市場的競爭由幾個關鍵因素驅動，包括提供持續技術創新的能力、產品和服務的品質和差異化、客戶關係的強度和穩定性、吸引和留住頂尖工程人才的能力以及潛在的地緣政治貿易限制。我們的成功取決於提供全面的整合解決方案，以解決日益複雜的半導體和系統設計問題。"},{"en":"Our competitors range from large, established providers to smaller, specialized firms, emerging companies, and internal design teams within major technology corporations. Key competitors include Synopsys, Inc., Ansys, Inc. (acquired by Synopsys), Siemens EDA, and a variety of other tool providers, electronics device manufacturers with in-house EDA capabilities, technical and computational software companies, electronics design and consulting firms, and IP companies. U.S.-based competitors include Keysight Technologies, Inc., Schr dinger, Inc., and CEVA, Inc., while international competitors include Altium Limited (acquired by Renesas Electronics Corporation) and Zuken, Inc. (Japan) and emerging players in China such as Huada Empyrean, Xpeedic Technology, X-EPIC, Primarius Technologies, Univista, and Giga Design Automation. Additionally, some competitors have pursued acquisitions, partner","zh":"我們的競爭對手包括大型成熟供應商、小型專業公司、新興公司、大型科技公司的內部設計團隊。主要競爭對手包括 Synopsys, Inc.、Ansys, Inc.（被 Synopsys 收購）、Siemens EDA 以及各種其他工具供應商、具有內部 EDA 能力的電子設備製造商、技術和運算軟體公司、電子設計和顧問公司以及 IP 公司。美國的競爭對手包括Keysight Technologies, Inc.、Schr dinger, Inc.和CEVA, Inc.，國際競爭對手包括Altium Limited（被瑞薩電子公司收購）和Zuken, Inc.（日本），以及中國的新興參與者，如Huada Empyrean、Xpeedic Technology、X-EPIC、Primarius Technologies、Univista和Giga Designm Autovisation。此外，一些競爭對手已經尋求收購、合作夥伴"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Productandmaintenance","val":4821589000,"zh":"產品與維護"},{"name":"Technology Service","val":475170000,"zh":"技術服務"}],"total":5296759000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":2479314000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":2310965000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Asia","val":1685203000,"zh":"亞洲"},{"name":"Other Asia","val":1005232000,"zh":"其他亞洲地區"},{"name":"EMEA","val":790569000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"CN","val":679971000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"JP","val":341673000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"Other America","val":168349000,"zh":"其他美國"}],"total":5296759000}},"peers":["SNPS","KLAC","LRCX","ANET","ADI"]}}